        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.118,
            0.612,
            0.155
          ],
          "content": "What is the difference 15 $\\frac { 3 } { 1 0 } \\frac { 4 } { 1 0 0 }   -   2   \\frac { 6 } { 1 0 } \\frac { 8 } { 1 0 0 }   ?$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.167,
            0.522,
            0.186
          ],
          "content": "One way to solve this is as follows:"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.233,
            0.21,
            0.371,
            0.279
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_12_image_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.417,
            0.207,
            0.583,
            0.279
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_12_image_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.235,
            0.294,
            0.353,
            0.331
          ],
          "content": "-   2   \\frac { 6 } { 1 0 }   \\mathrm { ~ \\frac { 8 } { 1 0 0 } ~ }",
          "image_source": "images/page_12_equation_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.44,
            0.294,
            0.568,
            0.332
          ],
          "content": "-   2 \\quad { \\frac { 6 } { 1 0 } } \\quad { \\frac { 8 } { 1 0 0 } }",
          "image_source": "images/page_12_equation_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.651,
            0.232,
            0.775,
            0.273
          ],
          "content": "12 14 14 10 100"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.645,
            0.294,
            0.783,
            0.38
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{1 - 2\\ \\frac{6}{10}\\ \\frac{8}{100}}{1 - 12\\ \\frac{6}{10}\\ \\frac{6}{100}}",
          "image_source": "images/page_12_equation_10.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.401,
            0.803,
            0.44
          ],
          "content": "Observe the subtraction done below for $6 5 3 - 2 6 8$ . Do you see any similarities with the methods shown above?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.818,
            0.392,
            0.905,
            0.444
          ],
          "content": "Math Talk"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.332,
            0.449,
            0.658,
            0.579
          ],
          "content": "\\begin{array}{l}\\left( 600+50+3 \\right) - \\left( 200+60+8 \\right) \\\\= \\left( 600-200 \\right) + \\left( 50-60 \\right) + \\left( 3-8 \\right) \\\\= \\left( 600-200 \\right) + \\left( 40-60 \\right) + \\left( 13-8 \\right) \\\\= \\left( 600-200 \\right) + \\left( 40-60 \\right) + 5 \\\\= \\left( 500-200 \\right) + \\left( 140-60 \\right) + 5 \\\\= 300+80+5 \\\\= 385\\end{array}",
          "image_source": "images/page_12_equation_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.588,
            0.293,
            0.61
          ],
          "content": "**Figure it Out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.609,
            0.461,
            0.627
          ],
          "content": "Find the sums and differences:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.634,
            0.341,
            0.671
          ],
          "content": "(a) $\\frac { 3 } { 1 0 }   +   3   \\frac { 4 } { 1 0 0 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.542,
            0.633,
            0.779,
            0.672
          ],
          "content": "(b) $9   \\frac { 5 } { 1 0 } \\frac { 7 } { 1 0 0 } + 2   \\frac { 1 } { 1 0 } \\frac { 3 } { 1 0 0 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.681,
            0.451,
            0.72
          ],
          "content": "(c) $15\\frac{6}{10}\\frac{4}{100}+14\\frac{3}{10}\\frac{6}{100}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.542,
            0.681,
            0.721,
            0.719
          ],
          "content": "(d) $7   \\frac { 7 } { 1 0 0 }   -   4   \\frac { 4 } { 1 0 0 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.191,
            0.73,
            0.367,
            0.769
          ],
          "content": "(e) $8\\frac{6}{100} = 5\\frac{3}{100}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.542,
            0.729,
            0.784,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": "(f) $1 2   { \\frac { 6 } { 1 0 0 } }   { \\frac { 2 } { 1 0 0 } }   -   { \\frac { 9 } { 1 0 } }   { \\frac { 9 } { 1 0 0 } }$"
        },
        {
